                    Essential <span style="color:var(--cyan);">Civil & Infrastructure Talent.</span>
                </h1>
                <p style="font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 15px; color: var(--text-muted);">
                    Without stamped plans and licensed engineers, multi-million dollar developments stall, public works freeze, and permitting stalls out. We deliver the Professional Engineers (PE), structural specialists, and site development leaders who move projects from drawing boards to execution.
                </p>
                <p style="font-style: italic; color: var(--cyan); font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.05rem;">
                    Permanent placements for civil engineering firms, infrastructure groups, and municipal consultants. We recruit the licensed talent that keeps your project backlog moving.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- SPLIT SECTION: WHY STREAMLINE & CONTACT FORM -->
            <div class="home-split-grid" style="margin-bottom: 80px;">
                <div>
                    <h2 style="margin-bottom:20px; color: var(--navy); font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 700;">Zero Downtime for Stamped Engineering Capacity</h2>
                    <p style="margin-bottom: 20px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">
                        Civil engineering is pure infrastructure—when key PE talent leaves or a project scales beyond team capacity, firms face missed submittal deadlines, lost project bids, and burnt-out staff.
                    </p>
                    <p style="margin-bottom: 20px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">
                        We specialize in placing hard-to-find licensed professionals across Water/Wastewater, Transportation, Structural, Land Development, Geotechnical, and Environmental Engineering. Every candidate is verified for licensure, project portfolio history, and software proficiency.
                    </p>
                    <p style="margin-top: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--navy); font-size: 1.05rem;">
                        Contingency based. You only pay when we deliver.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- LEAD CAPTURE FORM CARD -->
                <div class="card" style="text-align: left; background: var(--card-bg); box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);">
                    <h3 style="color:var(--navy); margin-bottom:10px; text-align: center; font-size: 1.4rem;">Expand Stamped Capacity</h3>
                    <p style="margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Tell us what project roles need coverage.</p>
                    
                    <form action="https://formspree.io/f/mjgpkbyq" method="POST">
                        <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your Name" required>
                        <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Work Email" required>
                        <input type="tel" name="phone" placeholder="Phone Number" required>
                        <textarea name="message" rows="3" placeholder="Role details (e.g. Senior Structural PE, Water/Wastewater Project Manager)" required></textarea>
                        <button type="submit" class="btn" style="width: 100%; border: none; cursor: pointer;">Request Talent</button>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- PROOF OF PERFORMANCE GRID -->
            <div style="margin-bottom: 80px;">
                <h2 style="margin-bottom: 30px; border-left: 4px solid var(--cyan); padding-left: 15px; color: var(--navy); font-weight: 700;">
                    Proven Civil Placements
                </h2>
                <div class="grid-3">
                    <div class="card">
                        <h4 style="color:var(--navy); margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 1.1rem;">Senior Structural Engineer (PE)</h4>
                        <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Placed a licensed Structural PE to lead bridge inspection and design submittals for a $45M highway expansion project.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card">
                        <h4 style="color:var(--navy); margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 1.1rem;">Water/Wastewater Project Manager</h4>
                        <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Secured a seasoned PM with municipal treatment facility expertise to oversee a regional water utility upgrade program.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card">
                        <h4 style="color:var(--navy); margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 1.1rem;">Site Development Civil Engineer</h4>
