                    </div>
                    <div class="card">
                        <h4 style="color:var(--navy); margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 1.1rem;">Transportation & Traffic Engineer (PE)</h4>
                        <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Placed a PE specializing in traffic impact studies and signalization design for large-scale commercial developments.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card">
                        <h4 style="color:var(--navy); margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 1.1rem;">Geotechnical Lead Engineer</h4>
                        <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Recruited a senior geotech specialist for foundation engineering and soil risk mitigation on heavy civil infrastructure projects.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card">
                        <h4 style="color:var(--navy); margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 1.1rem;">Director of Land Development</h4>
                        <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Placed an executive engineering director to lead civil operations and expansion for a regional consulting engineering firm.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- BANNER -->
            <div style="background: var(--card-bg); padding: 40px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--border); margin-bottom: 80px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);">
                <h2 style="margin-bottom: 15px; color: var(--navy);">Engineered for Project Delivery</h2>
                <p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1.05rem;">
