                    </div>
                    <div class="card">
                        <p style="font-style:italic; margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-muted);">"Our site dev team was sinking under submittal deadlines. Streamline matched us with a senior civil engineer who knew our local municipality codes cold. Saved our project timeline."</p>
                        <strong style="color: var(--navy);">— Karen T., Principal Civil Engineer</strong>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card">
                        <p style="font-style:italic; margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-muted);">"Streamline doesn't send warm bodies. They send qualified, licensed professionals who understand the civil consulting space. They're our first call when we win new municipal work."</p>
                        <strong style="color: var(--navy);">— Strategic Partner, Civil Consulting Firm</strong>
